## 7. Which methods crossed 80.00% balanced accuracy, and why?

### 7.1 Protocol-average crossings: only strict GSE46306 within-dataset CV

The three rows below are the **only protocol means** at or above the benchmark. The strict cohort is primary; the reconciled cohort is sensitivity. All three use shrinkage LDA and 50 CpGs. A baseline crossing is not an augmentation improvement.

