### 7.3 Consistency of augmentation changes

A method may pass 80.00% while doing worse than the matched baseline. The following counts compare all paired complete pooled streams. “Win/tie/loss” refers only to BA; each augmentation seed is compared with its repeat's same real-only baseline. Fold wins compare the exact same held-out group. These exposures share people and are not independent statistical replicates.

