| notebooks/explore_results.ipynb | Inspection notebook reading saved aggregate CSVs |
| overall_summary.readme | This comprehensive Markdown summary, with newly derived precision/F1 and crossing ledger |

Table sources: [loader/audit](src/methylation_diffusion/data.py), [runner](src/methylation_diffusion/runner.py), [report builder](scripts/build_report.py), [artifact verifier](scripts/verify_results.py), [Git exclusions](.gitignore). Local predictions/manifests/checkpoints are ignored by Git, while small aggregate reports are retained. No code license or dataset redistribution rights are assumed. No credentials or raw participant-level data are reproduced in this summary; links identify local evidence rather than embedding private metadata.

### Verification performed for this document

All 540 primary prediction files were recomputed at the fixed threshold, all continuous-score AUCs were recalculated, all 130 complete pooled streams and 28 protocol/method means were checked against existing metrics, and all 144 fold / 18 pooled / 3 aggregate benchmark crossings were enumerated. Feature-count consistency, source/config/split fingerprint agreement, manifest labels, threshold decisions, disjoint saved sample IDs and LOCO chip separation were checked. Training was not called. Existing source, configs, reports, predictions, metrics, diagnostics, splits and checkpoints were preserved, as was README.md.

Current verified primary fingerprint: `623e94c182280a17869938ceaffb67243405b8741444067a76956ab98831a686`. Documentation recalculation evidence is saved locally in [outputs/logs/overall_summary_verification.json](outputs/logs/overall_summary_verification.json). All printed percentages use two decimal places and AUCs four decimals; benchmark decisions and comparisons use unrounded values.
